{
  "$comment": "The host's published style contract for desktop plugins: the class names and CSS custom properties a plugin may rely on. Everything else in the host's CSS can be renamed or removed in any release. Tokens are listed by name only: their values change with the theme (data-theme / data-skin / data-bg), so never copy a value into a var() fallback. `check-plugin.mjs --style` reads this file; desktop/frontend/src/pluginContract.test.ts keeps it in step with the host CSS.",
